# Skadi's Veil

A visually stunning, heavily curated Skyrim overhaul built for immersion — gorgeous ENB/Lux lighting, lush 3D flora, and sweeping landscapes, paired with fluid MCO/ADXP combat, smarter AI, and reworked cities.

**Status:** Work in progress. Full readme coming soon.

Questions or issues? Join the Discord: https://discord.gg/tgBPcsZfyw

If you get the following missing files link, from a failed isntall

https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FirebirdGaming/Images/main/Wabbajack%20file%20fail.webp

Select the Link page and manually download the file

Once downloaded, put it in the downloads folder you selected for Skadi's Veil
